---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
const description = 'Privacy information for visitors contacting Puerto Viejo Volleyball Academy through its website.';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Puerto Viejo Volleyball Academy" description={description}>
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Website information" title="Privacy matters." description="This website uses Google analytics tools to understand how visitors use it. It does not collect form submissions." number="10" />
  <section class="content-section content-section-narrow prose">
    <h2>Contacting PVVA</h2><p>If you contact the academy by email or WhatsApp, the information you choose to share is handled by those services and PVVA. Avoid sending sensitive personal information in an initial inquiry.</p>
    <h2>Donations</h2><p>Donations are made through PayPal, outside this website. PayPal handles payment details under its own privacy policy.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2><p>This website uses Google Tag Manager to load Google measurement tools, such as Google Analytics. These tools use cookies and similar technologies to collect information like the pages you visit, how long you stay, your device and browser type, and your approximate location. PVVA uses this information only to understand how the site is used and to improve it. Google processes this data under its own <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy</a>. You can block these cookies in your browser settings or use the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>.</p>
    <h2>Website data</h2><p>This website does not include a contact form, advertising pixels, or account registration. The hosting provider may process standard technical logs to deliver and protect the site.</p>
    <h2>Before launch</h2><p>PVVA should review and update this notice to reflect its actual registration process, data retention practices, hosting provider, and any third-party tools used by the final website.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:pvvolleyballacademy@gmail.com">pvvolleyballacademy@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>